# Android TWA (Bubblewrap). Only twa-manifest.json is tracked: everything else
# under android/ is regenerated by `bubblewrap init` (Gradle wrapper, app
# sources, build output), so committing it would add binaries to the repo for
# no benefit — the APK is built locally and published as a GitHub Release.
# The keystore is NEVER committed: it is the app's identity, and anyone holding
# it can ship an "update" to your users. See docs/ANDROID.md.
android/*
!android/twa-manifest.json
*.keystore
*.jks

